Targeted suites for fix/5238-session-lock-ps-denial, head ab07106b (plus one base-commit comparison).
Host: Linux 6.18.7 x86_64, NixOS; /bin/ln absent; pid 1 = systemd; orphan reparent target = 1310 (sandbox subreaper).

